        {
            "id": "https://costalong.com/2026/03/12/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture/",
            "url": "https://costalong.com/2026/03/12/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture/",
            "title": "ClawHub 技术解密：AI Agent Skill 注册中心的架构实现",
            "date_published": "2026-03-12T04:00:00.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p>npm 之于 JavaScript、PyPI 之于 Python，OpenClaw 的 Skill 也需要一个发布和分发的地方，这就是 ClawHub。它的源码是公开的，这篇对照仓库代码看看它是怎么实现的。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>代码版本说明</strong><br>文中代码片段摘自 <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub\">openclaw/clawhub</a> 在 2026-03-12 的 main 分支（commit <code>b32a499</code>），为便于阅读做了删减。2026-10 复核时主干已经有不少变化，涉及的地方在正文里单独标注。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"893\" style=\"--img-ar:1.7917\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture_f8e1ed0fcec3.webp\" alt=\"ClawHub 技术架构全景图，展示 Convex 后端、TanStack Start 前端、向量搜索和 CLI 四大模块的连接关系，蓝紫色调科技风\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"ClawHub-是什么\"><a href=\"#ClawHub-是什么\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"ClawHub 是什么\"></a>ClawHub 是什么</h2><p>ClawHub 是 OpenClaw（早期名为 Clawdbot，项目和 CLI 也因此曾叫 ClawdHub / <code>clawdhub</code>）的<strong>公共 Skill 注册中心</strong>。它的核心职责是：让开发者能发布、版本化、搜索和安装 AI Agent 的 skill——本质上是一个 <code>SKILL.md</code> 加上配套文件的 bundle。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>项目概况</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub\">openclaw/clawhub</a>（写作时约 5.5k stars，截至 2026-10 约 9.5k）</li>\n<li>技术栈: TypeScript + Convex + TanStack Start + React 19</li>\n<li>许可证: MIT</li>\n<li>官网: <a href=\"https://clawhub.ai/\">clawhub.ai</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>和 npm 或 Homebrew 这类传统包管理器不同，ClawHub 分发的不是二进制文件或代码包，而是<strong>文本形式的 Agent 指令</strong>。这决定了它的架构在搜索、安全审查和版本管理上做了很多针对性设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"技术栈全景\"><a href=\"#技术栈全景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"技术栈全景\"></a>技术栈全景</h2><p>ClawHub 的技术选型可以概括为四层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前端</td>\n<td>TanStack Start + React 19 + Tailwind CSS 4</td>\n<td>SSR 渲染、路由、Skill 浏览 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后端</td>\n<td>Convex（实时数据库 + Serverless Functions）</td>\n<td>数据存储、业务逻辑、HTTP API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索</td>\n<td>OpenAI <code>text-embedding-3-small</code> + Convex 向量索引</td>\n<td>语义搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具链</td>\n<td>Bun + Vite 7（2026-10 已升到 Vite 8）+ Vitest + oxlint</td>\n<td>构建、测试、代码质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个组合的核心思路是：<strong>用 Convex 同时承担数据库和后端逻辑</strong>，省掉独立的 API 服务器和 ORM 层。前端选 TanStack Start 而非 Next.js，与 Convex 的实时订阅模型配合更自然。</p>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"1073\" style=\"--img-ar:1.4911\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture_6f4c83244bd6.webp\" alt=\"Convex 作为 ClawHub 数据中枢的示意图，展示 queries/mutations/actions 三种函数类型如何与前端和外部服务交互\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"数据模型：Skill-的生命周期\"><a href=\"#数据模型：Skill-的生命周期\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"数据模型：Skill 的生命周期\"></a>数据模型：Skill 的生命周期</h2><p>ClawHub 的 Convex schema 定义了几个核心表。<code>skills</code> 表的结构揭示了一个 skill 从发布到展示的完整生命周期：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// convex/schema.ts（核心字段，省略部分）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> skills <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">defineTable</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  slug<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>                    <span class=\"token comment\">// URL 友好的唯一标识</span>\n  displayName<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>             <span class=\"token comment\">// 显示名称</span>\n  summary<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>     <span class=\"token comment\">// 一句话描述</span>\n  ownerUserId<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'users'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>          <span class=\"token comment\">// 作者</span>\n  latestVersionId<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'skillVersions'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  tags<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">record</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'skillVersions'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// latest, v1.0.0 等</span>\n  badges<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> badgesValidator<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>             <span class=\"token comment\">// 官方认证、高亮、弃用标记</span>\n  moderationVerdict<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>       <span class=\"token comment\">// 安全审查结论</span>\n    v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">union</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'clean'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'suspicious'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'malicious'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  moderationEvidence<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">array</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">object</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    code<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    severity<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">union</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'info'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'warn'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'critical'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    file<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    line<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    message<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    evidence<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  quality<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">object</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>       <span class=\"token comment\">// 质量评分</span>\n    score<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    decision<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">union</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'pass'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'quarantine'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'reject'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    trustTier<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">union</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'low'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'medium'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'trusted'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\">// ...</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  stats<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> statsValidator<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>               <span class=\"token comment\">// 下载数、star 数、评论数</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>几个设计要点：</p>\n<p><strong>标签即版本指针</strong>。<code>tags</code> 字段是一个 <code>Record&lt;string, Id&lt;'skillVersions'&gt;&gt;</code>，<code>latest</code> 指向最新稳定版，语义版本号指向具体版本。这比维护独立的 latest 字段更灵活——你可以有 <code>beta</code>、<code>canary</code> 等任意标签。</p>\n<p><strong>审查结论内嵌到 skill 记录</strong>。moderation 相关字段直接在 <code>skills</code> 表上，而不是独立表。这样查询 skill 列表时不需要 JOIN，Convex 的单表查询性能直接受益。</p>\n<p><strong>软删除 + 预留 slug</strong>。删除 skill 并不是物理删除，而是设置 <code>softDeletedAt</code>。同时有一套 slug 预留机制（90 天冷却期），防止有人抢注被删除的知名 skill 名称。</p>\n<h2 id=\"向量搜索：不只是关键词匹配\"><a href=\"#向量搜索：不只是关键词匹配\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"向量搜索：不只是关键词匹配\"></a>向量搜索：不只是关键词匹配</h2><p>ClawHub 的搜索是这个项目最有技术含量的部分之一。它组合了向量相似度、词法匹配和流行度三个信号：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// convex/search.ts（评分逻辑）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">SLUG_EXACT_BOOST</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.4</span>      <span class=\"token comment\">// slug 精确匹配加分</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">SLUG_PREFIX_BOOST</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span>     <span class=\"token comment\">// slug 前缀匹配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">NAME_EXACT_BOOST</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.1</span>      <span class=\"token comment\">// 名称精确匹配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">NAME_PREFIX_BOOST</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.6</span>     <span class=\"token comment\">// 名称前缀匹配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">POPULARITY_WEIGHT</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.08</span>    <span class=\"token comment\">// 流行度权重</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">scoreSkillResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>queryTokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> vectorScore<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> displayName<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> slug<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> downloads<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> lexicalBoost <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">getLexicalBoost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>queryTokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> displayName<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> slug<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> popularityBoost <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log1p</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>downloads<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token constant\">POPULARITY_WEIGHT</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> vectorScore <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> lexicalBoost <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> popularityBoost\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>搜索流程分三步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>生成 embedding</strong>：用 OpenAI <code>text-embedding-3-small</code>（1536 维）对查询文本做嵌入，调用 Convex 的向量索引获取候选集</li>\n<li><strong>词法加权</strong>：对候选结果做 slug 和名称的 token 匹配，精确匹配加 1.4 分，前缀匹配加 0.6-0.8 分</li>\n<li><strong>流行度加成</strong>：用 <code>log1p(downloads)</code> 做对数平滑，避免下载量大的 skill 过度霸榜</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种混合排序策略解决了纯向量搜索的常见问题：用户搜「padel」时，名字就叫 <code>padel</code> 的 skill 应该排第一，而不是语义相似但名字不同的结果。</p>\n<p>2026-10 的主干上，这段逻辑又调整过：slug 与查询完全一致时的加分提高到 <code>EXACT_SLUG_BOOST = 2.5</code>，原来的 1.4 变成了”slug 的每个 token 都精确匹配”时的 <code>SLUG_TOKEN_BOOST</code>；<code>scoreSkillResult</code> 里的下载量加成被去掉了，排序另外引入了按匹配程度分档（<code>rankTier</code>）的机制。</p>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"1073\" style=\"--img-ar:1.4911\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture_5a30049442f6.webp\" alt=\"ClawHub 混合搜索流程图：用户查询 → OpenAI Embedding → Convex 向量索引 → 词法加权 → 流行度修正 → 排序结果\"></p>\n<p>嵌入生成模块本身也做了工程化处理：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// convex/lib/embeddings.ts</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">EMBEDDING_MODEL</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'text-embedding-3-small'</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1536</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">MAX_ATTEMPTS</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">BASE_RETRY_DELAY_MS</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1_000</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 无 API Key 时降级为零向量，搜索功能不会完全不可用</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">!</span>apiKey<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token builtin\">console</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">warn</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'OPENAI_API_KEY is not configured; using zero embeddings'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token function\">emptyEmbedding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// Array(1536).fill(0)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>没有 OpenAI API Key 时，搜索降级为纯词法匹配，不会崩溃。这种<strong>优雅降级</strong>思路贯穿整个项目。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全审查引擎\"><a href=\"#安全审查引擎\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安全审查引擎\"></a>安全审查引擎</h2><p>作为一个接受社区上传 skill 的平台，安全是 ClawHub 的核心关注点。它内置了一个静态安全扫描引擎，在 skill 发布时自动运行：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// convex/lib/moderationEngine.ts</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">scanCodeFile</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> findings<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 检测 child_process 调用</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token regex\"><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-source language-regex\">child_process</span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> execPattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">addFinding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>findings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      code<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token constant\">REASON_CODES</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">DANGEROUS_EXEC</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      severity<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'critical'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      file<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> path<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      line<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> match<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>line<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      message<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Shell command execution detected (child_process).'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      evidence<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> match<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>text<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 检测 eval/new Function</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token regex\"><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-source language-regex\">\\beval\\s*\\(|new\\s+Function\\s*\\(</span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">addFinding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>findings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      code<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token constant\">REASON_CODES</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">DYNAMIC_CODE</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      severity<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'critical'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token comment\">// ...</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>审查引擎扫描的内容包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>代码文件</strong>（.js/.ts/.py/.sh 等）：检查 <code>child_process</code>、<code>eval</code>、<code>new Function</code> 等危险调用</li>\n<li><strong>非标准端口</strong>的网络请求</li>\n<li><strong>Manifest 文件</strong>（JSON/YAML）中的可疑配置</li>\n<li><strong>Markdown 文件</strong>中的隐藏指令</li>\n</ul>\n<p>扫描结果产生三级 verdict：<code>clean</code>（安全）、<code>suspicious</code>（可疑）、<code>malicious</code>（恶意）。可疑和恶意的 skill 会被标记或隐藏，管理员可以通过 <code>manualOverride</code> 字段手动覆盖自动判定（2026-10 的 schema 里这个字段已标为弃用、等待迁移移除）。</p>\n<p>此外，ClawHub 还接入了 VirusTotal API 做恶意文件扫描（未配置 Key 时跳过），并把 VirusTotal 和 LLM 审查这两个外部扫描器的结论合入最终判定；另有一个质量评分系统，自动隔离过短、模板化的低质量提交。</p>\n<p>这套机制的背景是 2026 年 2 月 Koi Security 在 ClawHub 上发现的 341 个恶意 Skill（代号 ClawHavoc），它们主要靠 SKILL.md 里诱导用户执行安装脚本，而不是靠代码文件本身，这也说明了只扫代码不够、Markdown 里的指令同样要审。</p>\n<h2 id=\"CLI-发布流程\"><a href=\"#CLI-发布流程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"CLI 发布流程\"></a>CLI 发布流程</h2><p>开发者通过 <code>clawhub</code> CLI 与注册中心交互。发布一个 skill 的完整流程如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 登录</span>\nclawhub login\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 准备 skill 目录</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">mkdir</span> my-skill <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">cd</span> my-skill\n<span class=\"token function\">cat</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> SKILL.md <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"token string\">'EOF'\n---\nname: my-skill\ndescription: A useful skill for data analysis\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    requires:\n      env:\n        - MY_API_KEY\n      bins:\n        - python3\n    primaryEnv: MY_API_KEY\n---\n\n## Usage\n...\nEOF</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 发布</span>\nclawhub publish <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">.</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--slug</span> my-skill <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--name</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"My Skill\"</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--version</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span>.0\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 验证</span>\nclawhub search <span class=\"token string\">\"my-skill\"</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>CLI 的 publish 命令在底层做了这些事：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// packages/clawdhub/src/cli/commands/publish.ts（简化；2026-10 该目录已改名为 packages/clawhub）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> filesOnDisk <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">listTextFiles</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>folder<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 强制要求 SKILL.md（也接受 skills.md）存在</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">!</span>filesOnDisk<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">some</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>f <span class=\"token operator\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'skill.md'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'skills.md'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">includes</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>f<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>relPath<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toLowerCase</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">fail</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'SKILL.md required'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 元数据放在 payload 字段，文件统一追加到 files 字段</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> form <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">FormData</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nform<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'payload'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token constant\">JSON</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> slug<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> displayName<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> version<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> changelog<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> acceptLicenseTerms<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tags <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> file <span class=\"token keyword\">of</span> filesOnDisk<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> blob <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Blob</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>bytes<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> type<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>contentType <span class=\"token operator\">??</span> <span class=\"token string\">'text/plain'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  form<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">append</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'files'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> blob<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>relPath<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// POST 到注册中心的 skills 接口（由 Convex HTTP Action 处理）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">apiRequestForm</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>registry<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> method<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'POST'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> path<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> ApiRoutes<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>skills<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> token<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> form <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ApiV1PublishResponseSchema<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>服务端收到后依次处理：文件存储 → 版本记录创建 → embedding 生成 → 安全扫描 → 全局统计更新。需要注意的是，Convex 里只有 mutation 是事务性的，action 可以调外部服务（OpenAI、VirusTotal）但本身不具备回滚能力，所以这条流水线是”在 action 里编排、把每一步的数据库写入放进各自的 mutation”，而不是一个整体事务。</p>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"1073\" style=\"--img-ar:1.4911\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture_70da138aaf49.webp\" alt=\"ClawHub Skill 发布流程：CLI publish → FormData 上传 → Convex HTTP Action → 文件存储/版本创建/Embedding 生成/安全扫描 四个并行步骤\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"本地开发：跑起来看看\"><a href=\"#本地开发：跑起来看看\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"本地开发：跑起来看看\"></a>本地开发：跑起来看看</h2><p>如果你想在本地跑 ClawHub 研究它的实现：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 前置条件：安装 Bun（package.json 的 preinstall 会拒绝 npm / pnpm）</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">curl</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-fsSL</span> https://bun.sh/install <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token function\">bash</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 克隆并安装依赖</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">git</span> clone https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub.git <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">cd</span> clawhub\nbun <span class=\"token function\">install</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">cp</span> .env.local.example .env.local\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 终端 A：启动 Convex 本地后端</span>\nbunx convex dev <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--typecheck</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>disable\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 终端 B：启动前端（端口 3000）</span>\nbun run dev\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 填充示例数据</span>\nbunx convex run --no-push devSeed:seedNixSkills</code></pre>\n\n<p>本地开发不需要 OpenAI API Key（搜索降级为零向量），也不需要 VirusTotal Key（安全扫描跳过）。只有 GitHub OAuth 需要配置才能测试登录功能。</p>\n<p>以上是 2026-03 时 README 里的步骤。截至 2026-10，完整流程移到了仓库的 CONTRIBUTING.md：多了一步 <code>bunx @convex-dev/auth</code> 生成 Convex Auth 的 JWT 密钥，示例数据改用 <code>bun run seed:dev</code> 填充，动手前以 CONTRIBUTING.md 为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构决策复盘\"><a href=\"#架构决策复盘\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"架构决策复盘\"></a>架构决策复盘</h2><p>ClawHub 的技术选型有几个值得关注的取舍：</p>\n<p><strong>选 Convex 不选 PostgreSQL + Express</strong>：Convex 把数据库、实时订阅、Serverless 函数、文件存储打包在一起，省掉了大量胶水代码。代价是强绑定 Convex 平台，迁移成本高。对于一个快速迭代的社区项目，这个取舍合理。</p>\n<p><strong>选 TanStack Start 不选 Next.js</strong>：TanStack Start 基于 Vite，与 Convex 的 React hooks 集成顺畅。写作时 TanStack Start 还在快速演进，选它需要承受 API 变动的风险。</p>\n<p><strong>选 Bun 不选 Node.js</strong>：package.json 里有 <code>\"preinstall\": \"bunx only-allow bun\"</code>，强制使用 Bun。Bun 的安装速度和 TypeScript 原生支持是主要动力。</p>\n<p><strong>安全扫描用正则不用 AST</strong>：ModerationEngine 用正则匹配危险模式，而非解析 AST。正则覆盖不了所有绕过手段，但对于文本为主的 skill bundle（大部分是 Markdown + 少量脚本），足够高效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动手试试\"><a href=\"#动手试试\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"动手试试\"></a>动手试试</h2><p>如果你正在构建 AI Agent 工具，以下步骤可以立即开始：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>浏览现有 skill</strong>：访问 <a href=\"https://clawhub.ai/\">clawhub.ai</a>，看看社区都在发布什么类型的 skill</li>\n<li><strong>安装 CLI</strong>：<code>npm install -g clawhub</code>（旧包名 <code>clawdhub</code>），用 <code>clawhub search</code> 体验向量搜索；OpenClaw 2026.9.9 也内置了 <code>openclaw skills search</code></li>\n<li><strong>发布你的第一个 skill</strong>：准备一个包含 <code>SKILL.md</code> 的目录，运行 <code>clawhub publish</code></li>\n<li><strong>阅读源码</strong>：从 <code>convex/schema.ts</code> 开始，理解数据模型；再看 <code>convex/search.ts</code> 研究搜索实现</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果你在构建类似的 Agent 工具注册中心，ClawHub 的向量搜索混合排序和静态安全扫描引擎两个模块值得重点研究。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考资料\"><a href=\"#参考资料\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"参考资料\"></a>参考资料</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub\"><strong>ClawHub GitHub 仓库</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://clawhub.ai/\"><strong>ClawHub 官网</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.convex.dev/\"><strong>Convex 官方文档</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tanstack.com/start/latest\"><strong>TanStack Start 文档</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/embeddings\"><strong>OpenAI Embeddings API 文档</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub/blob/main/VISION.md\"><strong>OpenClaw 项目 VISION.md</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n",
            "tags": [
                "Coding-Agent",
                "ClawHub",
                "OpenClaw",
                "AI-Agent",
                "Convex",
                "TanStack-Start"
            ]
        }
    ]
}